{"data":{"body":"**P2: Close the sampling bridge before ending the root span.** `Span.end()` invokes span processors synchronously. Keeping `openScope(intent)` active through `root.end(start)` causes unrelated spans created by processor/exporter callbacks on this thread to inherit this execution's sampling decision. Scope only `startSpan()`, then end the root after the scope closes; add a processor-callback regression test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc74if_P","finding_digest":"cdc830aeac841643715eee36a3bb84e5e1e8364ebaa16364d1e8d6fc75e9b251","finding_id":"arf_v1_zxedblvmqqleg4k65y3kho4e4x","finding_key":"otel-plugin/otelpluginsupport.java::exportexecutionroot::sampling-scope-leak","identity_key":"otel-plugin/otelpluginsupport.java::exportexecutionroot::sampling-scope-leak","line":52,"observation_digest":"d2f3d5f2404b2c624edbfdb739d216e4339db6783997a20f05d52121b77c30e9","observation_id":"aro_v1_2lz5l4sajmwgetw37w3ttuqw4q","path":"otel-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/otel/OtelPluginSupport.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_zxedblvmqqleg4k65y3kho4e4x","published_at":"2026-10-02T21:00:01Z","review_id":"arr_v1_nvb35ycpoping3derpgthnxicr","reviewed_base_sha":"61f5d103651c2bafc54f840a539cf55a95f47df7","reviewed_head_sha":"5c79837019fad6f9566fd0f4c4e225b7c678da52","reviewer":"codex","start_line":49,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_xtro5fy6c3bdaoyosiujs4r3ib"},"pull_request":{"number":767},"record_id":"art_v1_f7nqbstp4ybuhrsfx76xoqmzdo","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-02T21:00:01Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
